description	"Marl

A veteran Melee Duelist From Taris. Uses his experience and toughness to close the gap.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dueling Vibro-Staff (Staff)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Chain Limit: 4
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- Slows on hit

^8Attributes:
- BP Free Jumps
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Gritty Conditioning (Env Protection 1)
- Duelist's Fury (3)
- Anti MT (1)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (3)
- Armor Regen (2)
- 25% Less Knockback Taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Duelist's Rush (Rage 3) ^[CS3]
- Stimpack ^3[CS4]"
